<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — PARADOX Tools" description="Privacy policy for PARADOX Tools.">
<main class="static-page"><div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</div><h1>Simple by design.</h1><p>PARADOX Tools is designed so the core file tools process files in your browser. We do not require an account to use them.</p><h2>Files</h2><p>Your selected files are processed by the browser for the client-side tools on this site. Do not upload sensitive material to any third-party service unless you have reviewed that service's policy.</p><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>This site may use Google AdSense and related Google services after approval. Advertising and measurement services can use cookies or similar technologies subject to their own policies and your browser settings.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For site questions, use the contact address shown on our contact page.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated as features change.</p></main>
</BaseLayout>
